# --- keep this repo lean: only the game ships to GitHub ---
# The big branding source files (.psd/.tif and the 18-360MB AI renders) stay
# local — several exceed GitHub's 100MB hard limit and the game doesn't need
# them (sprites are already inlined into the HTML).

# ignore everything at the repo root by default...
/*

# ...then re-include only the game + docs
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/HypesCookinn.html
!/game

# within the game folder, drop debug previews and caches
game/assets/_*.png
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
